IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-GRAMMAR-PUSHDOWN.

DATA DIVISION.
01 SOURCE-LEN          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 STACK-DEPTH         PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SPARSITY-PCT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 LATENCY-NS          PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-GRAMMAR-PUSHDOWN.
    IF SOURCE-LEN == 0 OR STACK-DEPTH == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 78 TO SPARSITY-PCT.
    MOVE 68 TO LATENCY-NS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SOURCE-LEN.
    WEIGHT 30 LATENCY-NS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
